OL,3,ANew prisoner early release scheme
OL,4,Abegins as probation officer warns 'I've
OL,5,Ano idea how we'll cope'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne probation officer, who will be
OL,8,Fresponsible for monitoring some of the
OL,9,Fearly releases, says managing the
OL,10,Finflux of offenders is "just too much"
OL,12,FPrisoners being released early today
OL,13,Fwill include those convicted of fraud,
OL,14,Fdomestic abuse, and coercive control
OL,16,F"I am scared that he will come after me
OL,17,F- I don't want to die," one victim
OL,18,Ftells us - while another woman says
OL,19,Fshe's suffering "night terrors and
OL,20,Fpanic"
